      "writtenOn": "2013-07-10T16:10:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only difference between a PKI and UUID token is the way the token ID is generated. Therefore it make sense to have PKI provider subclass UUID class. UUID is a base class.\n\nV3TokenDataHelper is the utility class to put together the token data prior to signing. To make it easier for you, I\u0027ll move the V3TokenDataHelper to __init__() so you can extend it to add the Kerberos data.",
